{"en": "1325793288", "title": "⚙️ Untuk administrator sistem dan operator", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1, "localId": "d3e7f7c3aa2d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Untuk administrator sistem / operator"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "921d6f7a586e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menjalankan OpenELIS Global di lingkungan produksi: pencadangan (backup), pemantauan, pembaruan versi (upgrade), ketersediaan tinggi (high availability), dan masalah operasional sehari-hari."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "07332a23bcbb"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Untuk siapa halaman ini"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "df598cb325b4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Anda mengoperasikan satu atau beberapa instalasi OpenELIS Global. Perhatian utama Anda adalah waktu aktif (uptime), integritas data, keamanan, pemulihan, dan menjaga agar pengguna tetap produktif. Anda tidak harus menulis kode, tetapi Anda membaca log, menjalankan ulang container, mengonfigurasi pencadangan, merencanakan pembaruan versi, dan melakukan triase insiden. Jika Anda memasang OpenELIS untuk pertama kalinya di situs baru, baca terlebih dahulu "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Untuk tim implementasi", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326252042"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "86cde137f3de"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Runbook: minggu pertama Anda dengan instalasi baru"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "73bd0c34e653", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "0670582358c6"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "0fc99d74efd0"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Konfigurasi pencadangan", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/240320515"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": siapkan pencadangan segera. Uji pemulihan (restore) sebelum mulai beroperasi."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "336f8ceb18c0"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f9abc6a255bf"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pemecahan masalah", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/245366800"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": menjalankan ulang container, pengelolaan file log, diagnostik infohighway. Baca halaman ini sekali sebelum ada masalah agar Anda tahu halaman ini ada saat terjadi kerusakan."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "ce19fc349f05"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4096d0a11314"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menyiapkan failover ketersediaan tinggi", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/240877572"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": jika penerapan Anda memerlukan waktu aktif yang tinggi."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "8f00ad0ef790"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d6b395346e63"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Migrasi kata sandi", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/240222222"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": diperlukan satu kali jika Anda mengoperasikan instans yang dimigrasikan dari instalasi lama OE 1.x."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "574fb8cca23c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pembaruan versi"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "517cfb7ae91a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dokumentasi pembaruan versi:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "0691c1c25073"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "76185cbb8977"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2be6e928bed3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Memperbarui OpenELIS 3.x dan 2.x", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/239730698"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": alur pembaruan minor / patch saat ini"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "4f10f5bae44a"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "59d374b8ff06"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Memperbarui dari 2.x ke 2.7", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/239697942"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": migrasi DB termasuk konversi FHIR BLOB → relasional"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "4a169ec111ca"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "22d071fd5681"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Memperbarui dari OpenELIS Global 1.x ke 2.x", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/240386051"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": migrasi versi mayor"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a77db3bd524d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Selalu uji prosedur pembaruan versi terlebih dahulu di lingkungan non-produksi yang mencerminkan data produksi Anda. Selalu buat pencadangan yang telah diverifikasi sebelum memulai."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "c00e9d95eee7"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Operasi Consolidated Server"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "08d36a6a1787"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Jika Anda mengoperasikan Consolidated Server pusat yang menghimpun data dari beberapa situs laboratorium:"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "e6bc387a8c03"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "fd0eda32cbcc"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "e5d11c78829c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menerapkan Consolidated Server", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/239829042"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": arsitektur, firewall, penyiapan OpenHIM"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "aaf245301d5a"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1e9384e4c925"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menambahkan fasilitas ke Consolidated Server"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "1453b0663570"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5a06218bca72"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menambahkan peminta ke Consolidated Server"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "01b1b6f02517"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "78a88887e058"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pembaruan massal fasilitas dan katalog pemeriksaan melalui profil database"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "69b4a732ea96"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Panduan penanganan insiden umum"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "de533f1fbaa6"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Container tidak mau berjalan"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "230a9be0d22f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Langkah pertama selalu: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "sudo docker restart", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Jika tidak membantu, periksa log container ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "sudo docker logs openelisglobal-webapp", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). Halaman Pemecahan masalah memuat alur diagnostik yang lebih lengkap."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "9df61696fdf0"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Disk hampir penuh"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "06cd40359fbc"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "File log OE berada di "}, {"type": "text", "text": "/var/lib/openelis-global/logs/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " dan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "/var/lib/openelis-global/tomcatLogs/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Log daemon Docker berada di "}, {"type": "text", "text": "/var/lib/docker/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Halaman Pemecahan masalah memuat konfigurasi rotasi log "}, {"type": "text", "text": "daemon.json", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " yang direkomendasikan."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "da5fb08f4e96"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Login tidak berfungsi"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ee32a93c9a45"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Jika pengguna tidak dapat login setelah pembaruan versi, periksa Keycloak terlebih dahulu (log, status impor realm). "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Panduan pemecahan masalah RBAC", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1153728514"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " memuat tabel diagnostik dengan 15 gejala."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "b6f3d01a3642"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Daftar periksa keamanan & integritas data"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "9d7a5cc0f1fb"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "80d5659726c8"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "82c584636f0c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sertifikat SSL valid dan diperbarui sebelum kedaluwarsa"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "ec42508194d9"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d1bf5e617ac3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Kata sandi database diganti secara berkala dan disimpan di 1Password atau yang setara"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "f2f775f2d2c7"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "374714de11fa"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pencadangan diuji untuk pemulihan (bukan sekadar \"apakah file-nya ada\", tetapi benar-benar dipulihkan ke staging)"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "de0ef1b45d38"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8a93d39aed4f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Failover HA divalidasi setiap kuartal jika HA diperlukan"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "c8fbabc96f73"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "539ae985503b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tinjauan log audit untuk mendeteksi pola akses yang tidak biasa"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "a701fba25f12"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4d6ed4689465"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Jadwal patch untuk OS host (Ubuntu)"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "d2f212e507dc"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tempat mendapatkan bantuan"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "488332fc792a"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "4dbd2bd5e089"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c2235964f1a9"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "OpenELIS Talk", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://talk.openelis-global.org"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": forum komunitas, operator dari penerapan lain sering menanggapi"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "336dc85ce5bf"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8aa55ff84df1"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "GitHub Issues", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": laporkan bug yang Anda duga berasal dari produk"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "60ced433c122"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "3b5d6fedffe4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Vault 1Password", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": penyimpanan kata sandi tim Anda untuk semua kredensial OE"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "1002d77b9b15"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tetap mutakhir"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8b86cabf6e56"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pantau halaman "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rilis", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326219273"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " untuk pengumuman pembaruan versi dan patch keamanan."}]}], "version": 1}}